  "title": "Union Cabinet Approves ₹10,000 Crore SME Growth Fund",
  "summary": "The Indian government has approved a ₹10,000 crore commitment for a SME Growth Fund, which will provide equity capital to growing businesses to expand capacity, adopt technology, enter global markets, and join value chains. The fund targets manufacturing firms and industrial clusters in Tier-II and Tier-III cities to boost expansion and exports.",
